# AIL spec files

- Edit the spec (`*.ail.md`), never generated paths (`src/gen/**` and other target `generated` globs).
- Change behaviour in the spec, then build with MCP `ail_build` or `ail build`.
- For node shape, levels, workflows, and adopt guidance, read and follow [skills/ail/SKILL.md](skills/ail/SKILL.md).
- Language definition: [docs/language.md](docs/language.md).
- Tools: MCP `ail_show` (tree / node / changes), `ail_build`, `ail_adopt`.
